url: "https://github.com/ethan-pierce/landlab-triangle"
abstract: >-
  A Landlab grid type that builds unstructured triangular
  meshes from a boundary polygon using Jonathan Shewchuk's
  Triangle mesh generator. Supports irregular boundaries,
  interior holes, and variable resolution.
